Package: estimandYLL
Title: Years of Life Lost via the G-Formula
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Shuntaro", "Sato",
      email   = "shuntaro.sato.stat@gmail.com",
      role    = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6055-3649")
    )
Author: Shuntaro Sato [aut, cre] (ORCID:
    <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6055-3649>)
Maintainer: Shuntaro Sato <shuntaro.sato.stat@gmail.com>
Description: Estimates Years of Life Lost (YLL) and counterfactual life
    expectancy under user-specified interventions on a binary exposure using
    the parametric g-formula on the attained-age time scale. The main
    interface makes the target population, intervention, and result measure
    explicit, with bootstrap confidence intervals and helpers for plotting
    conditional and marginal survival curves.
